The Acolyte	25	{"kind":"quest","title":"The Acolyte","wikiPath":"/The_Acolyte","sources":[{"kind":"quest","where":"Rivervale","detail":"Start zone"},{"kind":"quest","where":"Gapeers Johhanis","detail":"Quest giver"}],"components":[{"name":"Algae Covered Flesh","qty":1,"wikiPath":"/Algae_Covered_Flesh"},{"name":"Swollen Flesh","qty":1,"wikiPath":"/Swollen_Flesh"},{"name":"Waterlogged Flesh","qty":1,"wikiPath":"/Waterlogged_Flesh"}],"rewards":[{"text":"Acolyte's Anklet","item":"Acolyte's Anklet","wikiPath":"/Acolyte%27s_Anklet"}],"card":{"title":"The Acolyte","lines":["Minimum Level: 14","Classes: Cleric, Druid","Related Zones: Erud's Crossing, The Feerrott, West Freeport","Related NPCs: a drowned citizen, a zombie sailor, Greenblood zombie","Faction note: Requires Amiable faction with Priests of Mischief."]},"links":["Rivervale","Gapeers Johhanis","Cleric","Druid","Erud's Crossing","The Feerrott","Freeport","A drowned citizen","A zombie sailor","Greenblood zombie","Acolyte's Anklet","Priests of Mischief","Algae Covered Flesh","Feerrott","A drowned caravan guard","Swollen Flesh","West Freeport","Waterlogged Flesh","Mayor Gubbin","Guardians of the Vale"],"dialogue":[{"npc":"Gapeers Johhanis jumps at your voice, he's obviously very focused on a set of beakers on the table. They seem to be holding samples of rotted flesh. Gapeers","text":"Oh my heart! You could have stopped it! Please be careful when entering these chambers. It would be unfortunate if I had dropped and broken these [specimens]."},{"npc":"Gapeers Johhanis turns to explain the specimens when he accidentally knocks over the beakers. He sucks in a short breath as the beakers crash to the ground, ruining the samples. As Gapeers's skin loses color he","text":"OH NO!! No, not my specimens!! Now what am I to do?! I needed those badly! You did this! You [owe] me now!"},{"npc":"Gapeers Johhanis","text":"You bet you do! You big clumsy Half Elf! These were the remains of unfortunates who were drowned. Not only were they drowned but their bodies clung to life and refused to settle. Products of the horrendous curse of unlife. I'll need you to find three [special samples] of drowned and cursed flesh."},{"npc":"Gapeers Johhanis's eyes widen as he realizes you actually might intend to help him. His voice becomes raspy with desperation as he","text":"Oh! Wonderful....uuhhmmm.... well ....You'll need to find undead creatures found in the waters of three different climates. One from a tropical ocean. One from the muddy and slow moving river of a jungle. And one from the stagnate and polluted water of a city's sewer, Freeport would be ideal. Will you really [do this for me]?"},{"npc":"Gapeers Johhanis","text":"Oh thank goodness! Thank you so much, ______! Those old specimens were much to ancient anyway, fresh ones will help in my mission to heal those who were unfortunate enough to drown and become cursed. If you bring back the three samples I have a little something you might like. Although it will only fit and be of use to one who heals as a profession and is small of stature like myself. Good luck!"},{"npc":"Gapeers Johhanis cheers as you hand him the samples of zombie flesh. He","text":"You have them! Excellent! Thank you very much, ______! Now I have much work to do so shoo before you break something else. Oh and here is your reward. It's an anklet that all our acolytes wear. Not only is it functional, but we can show off our beautiful foot hairs at the same time. Us halflings are pretty smart really."}],"fetchedAt":"2026-09-23T06:04:29.591Z","outOfEra":false}
HEHE Meat Quest	25	{"kind":"quest","title":"HEHE Meat Quest","wikiPath":"/HEHE_Meat_Quest","sources":[{"kind":"quest","where":"Grobb","detail":"Start zone"},{"kind":"quest","where":"Carver Cagrek","detail":"Quest giver"}],"components":[{"name":"HEHE Meat","qty":1,"wikiPath":"/HEHE_Meat"}],"rewards":[{"text":"Grobb Cleaver","item":"Grobb Cleaver","wikiPath":"/Grobb_Cleaver"}],"card":{"title":"HEHE Meat Quest","lines":["Minimum Level: 20","Classes: Warrior, Shadow Knight","Related Zones: Neriak Foreign Quarter, Ocean of Tears, Oggok","Related NPCs: Chef Dooga, Nerbilik, The Gobbler"]},"links":["Grobb","Carver Cagrek","Warrior","Shadow Knight","Neriak","Ocean of Tears","Oggok","Chef Dooga","Nerbilik","The Gobbler","Grobb Cleaver","HEHE Meat","Tattered Recipe","Clurg","Kazon Stormhammer","Green Blood Knights","Craknek Warriors","Oggok Guards","High Elf Flesh","Preserved Leg","Neriak Ogre","Ogre Butcher Gloves","DaBashers","Grobb Merchants","Broken Skull Clan"],"dialogue":[{"npc":"Carver Cagrek","text":"HEHE meat!! What dat stand for? Mes need some of dis HEHE meat!! Gos and get me some. Cagrek not just want some. Cagrek want more dan twenny!! Cagrek want three HEHE meat and mes want HEHE recipe. Youg et and me makes _____ honeraree carver. Me gives you Grobb Cleaver. It cut skins like dey butter!!"},{"npc":"Chef Dooga","text":"Welcome you, _____. You look all skin 'n bones. Eat you must do. Chef Dooga can fix up goodies for you. Try [HEHE meat]."},{"npc":"Chef Dooga","text":"It is a secret ground meat made with high elf, human, and Erudite Flesh. Mmmm. It good stuff. Dooga make it and [the Gobbler] make it. If you find any of those meats in the swamps bring to me and I pay you."},{"npc":"Chef Dooga","text":"MmmmMmm. Human make good meat pies. Here. A little coins for you."},{"npc":"Chef Dooga","text":"High elf!! Now that is a good meat. Goes good with Ogre Swill."},{"npc":"Chef Dooga","text":"You no hear of the Gobbler!! Him great butcher. Have all kinds of meat. Him am low on froglok legs. Dooga supply him. Dooga need someone to [deliver froglok legs]."},{"npc":"Chef Dooga","text":"You think so!! That be good thing. Make the Gobbler happy. Maybe he give you something good. Maybe not. you take this. Deliver meat."},{"npc":"The Gobbler","text":"Meat!! You need meat. Me gots meat!! High elf meat, dwarf meat, human meat, [HEHE meat], [froggy legs]. Me got a lot."},{"npc":"The Gobbler","text":"HEHE meat? It human, Erudite 'n high elf, mashed together. Mmmm. Very tasty!"},{"npc":"The Gobbler","text":"Froggy legs come from far away. Me get from friend, [Chef Dooga]. It not tasty. Trolls like it. Eat it up much. They eat too much froggy. Me glad [Nerbilik] leave Neriak!! He eat way too much froggy."},{"npc":"The Gobbler","text":"Friend in Oggok is Chef Dooga. Chef she is. Used to work in Neriak. She beautiful. She supply the Gobbler with [froglok legs]. They very low now. Fat trolls eat too many!! Me need to [pick up froglok legs]."},{"npc":"The Gobbler","text":"That good news. Oggok far away. Me got no time to go. If you go speak to Chef Dooga, say you pick up froglok legs. You bring back and me give you coin, maybe even something good."},{"npc":"The Gobbler","text":"Big and fat troll Nerbilik is. He leave to fish in tearsy ocean. Me promised to deliver him food or he come bak. The Gobbler needs some dumb person to [deliver grub locker] to Nerbilik."},{"npc":"The Gobbler","text":"Good. Me wrap order of dwarf pickles in.. HEY!! Me out of special wrapping paper!! Hmm.. Here. Me use dis. Now, Here. You take to Nerbilik in tearsy ocean and he pay you. No think of opening locker. Only Nerbilik has key."},{"npc":"Nerbilik","text":"What you want?!! Face so ugly you scare fish away!! ..sniff, sniff. Smell so bad, too!! Me sure is hungry. Wish had [grub locker]."},{"npc":"Nerbilik","text":"You gots grub locker!! Give to me. Me sick of fish and not many dwarves fall off ship. Me pay a plat to get me grub locker from the Gobbler in Neriak. Go to him and say you [deliver grub locker] if you wants one plat."},{"npc":"Nerbilik's corpse","text":"Curse you!! Da bashers will have yer head."},{"npc":"Carver Cagrek","text":"Yous a maroon or what! Me says bring back THREE HEHE meat and HEHE recipe!"},{"npc":"Carver Cagrek","text":"Yous a maroon or what! Me says bring back THREE HEHE meat and HEHE recipe!"},{"npc":"Carver Cagrek","text":"Yous a maroon or what! Me says bring back THREE HEHE meat and HEHE recipe!"},{"npc":"Carver Cagrek","text":"Finally! What takes yous so long? Now carver Cagrek try and makes meat and feeds to trolls. Yous getting to be deputy carver. Mes give you a Grobb cleaver! Make strong and smarts on you it will. Just like carver Cagrek."},{"npc":"The Gobbler","text":"Uggh!! Froglok legs!! Me hate smelly legs, but me need it for fat trolls."},{"npc":"Nerbilik","text":"You no get my wrapper!! Me use it later when me needs to make more room in stomach!! You never get it!!"},{"npc":"Nerbilik","text":"I shall pluck you limb from limb!!"}],"fetchedAt":"2026-09-23T06:04:30.682Z","outOfEra":false}
