Templar's Bracer	25	{"kind":"item","title":"Templar's Bracer","wikiPath":"/Templar's_Bracer","sources":[{"kind":"quest","where":"Cleric Kael Armor Quests"}],"components":[],"rewards":[],"card":{"title":"Templar's Bracer","icon":"https://eqlwiki.com/images/c/cf/Item_516.png","lines":["MAGIC ITEM NO DROP","Slot: WRIST","AC: 21","STR: +5 WIS: +2 HP: +35 MANA: +20","SV DISEASE: +2","Effect: Abundant Food (Must Equip, Casting Time: 10.0) at Level 50","WT: 3.5 Size: SMALL","Class: CLR","Race: ALL"]},"fetchedAt":"2026-09-23T06:12:09.318Z","outOfEra":true}
The Sword of Nobility	25	{"kind":"quest","title":"The Sword of Nobility","wikiPath":"/The_Sword_of_Nobility","sources":[{"kind":"quest","where":"Western Plains of Karana","detail":"Start zone"},{"kind":"quest","where":"Ryshon Hunsti","detail":"Quest giver"}],"components":[],"rewards":[{"text":"Ghoulbane","item":"Ghoulbane","wikiPath":"/Ghoulbane"}],"card":{"title":"The Sword of Nobility","lines":["Minimum Level: 30","Classes: Paladin","Related Zones: Butcherblock Mountains, Dagnor's Cauldron, The Estate of Unrest, High Keep, Lavastorm Mountains, Najena","Related NPCs: Kanthuk Ogrebane, Llara, Ruathey, a crazed ghoul, A crazed goblin (Butcherblock), a skeleton"]},"links":["Western Plains of Karana","Ryshon Hunsti","Paladin","Butcherblock Mountains","Dagnor's Cauldron","The Estate of Unrest","High Keep","Lavastorm Mountains","Najena","Kanthuk Ogrebane","Llara","Ruathey","A crazed ghoul","A crazed goblin (Butcherblock)","A skeleton","Ghoulbane","Dismiss Undead","Note to Kanthuk","A Pendant","Note to Ruathey","Nobleman's Bag","Amstaf's Scroll","Blade of Nobility","A Ghoul's Heart","Unrest","Hilt of the Nobleman","The Warrens","Lavastorm","Ghoul's Heart","Crazed Goblin","A pickclaw warrior"],"dialogue":[{"npc":"Ryshon Hunsti","text":"It is not just a sword friend. It is much more than that. This sword carries with it special [power], something unlike anything else within this realm."},{"npc":"Ryshon Hunsti","text":"It is an instrument fashioned together by noble man. It is said to be blessed by the gods themselves. Only a man whose bloodline comes from nobility may wield it. Do you seek the [sword of nobility]?"},{"npc":"Ryshon Hunsti","text":"I see, then take this note to Kanthuk Ogrebane. I've been told he can be found fishing not far from the dwarven city."},{"npc":"Kanthuk Ogrebane","text":"Hello"},{"npc":"Kanthuk Ogrebane","text":"Ahh, I see you have spoken to Ryshon. You seem tired from your long journey. Sit with me as I tell you a tale. A tale about a true friend of mine, a great man known as [Amstaf Trunolis]."},{"npc":"Kanthuk Ogrebane","text":"Amstaf Trunolis was a good man. I've followed him into [battle] many times. We've seen many of our friends die by the sword of others."},{"npc":"Kanthuk Ogrebane","text":"Ambreen was younger than he and I. She knew of the powers of nature. She was able to control the rain which fell from the heavens and would call upon the spirits to aide her. It was obvious that Amstaf took a liking to Ambreen. She ended up coming with us on our crusades. The last I saw of Ambreen was when we went to the snow covered lands of Everfrost. We were wandering the lands when a freak [snowstorm] hit us. We were separated from one another for quite some time."},{"npc":"Kanthuk Ogrebane","text":"I don't know where it came from, but it was so sudden that it caught us all off guard. The snow quickly became unbearable. I tried to move to higher ground, but was unable to. I was stuck within the snowy confines. I didn't know what to do [next]."},{"npc":"Kanthuk Ogrebane","text":"As I laid there my body began to slowly freeze. I knew death was near and accepted the inevitable. Suddenly I felt something clutching at my cloak. I was being dragged upwards out of the snow. A hand pressed against my chest and began to glow. I felt energy pass into my body. Do you know [how] he had saved me?"},{"npc":"Kanthuk Ogrebane","text":"He saved my life by laying his hands upon my body. A few moments later we found Ambreen lying in the snow, her body frozen by the harsh surroundings. We lifted her up off the ground and began to look for [shelter]."},{"npc":"Kanthuk Ogrebane","text":"We ended up taking refuge within a deserted cabin not too far from our location. We knew that we didn't have much time left to bring life back into her body. However, the storm didn't pass through and we knew we couldn't venture too far without the fear of freezing. I warmed the cabin and rested for some time thinking about what we were going to do. It wasn't long before my exhaustion took over. I fell into a deep [slumber] that night."},{"npc":"Kanthuk Ogrebane","text":"That night I dreamt of many things. Random thoughts kept swirling around my mind. I kept seeing the image of a cloaked being and of Amstaf circled around a fire. I saw Ambreen's body convulsing above the fire as if life was being brought back to it. I don't know what happened that night. I don't even know if what I dreamt was real, but before I awoke I saw a [strange image]."},{"npc":"Kanthuk Ogrebane","text":"I saw Amstaf lower his head and walk away in silence. He was surrounded by two beings carrying a torch. I don't know what it meant, but I swear it was so real. When I awoke both Amstaf and Ambreen were gone. Please find Llara and give this pendant to her. This pendant belonged to Amstaf. She too had a vision that night that may clear things up. If she asks where you got it from, mention my name."},{"npc":"Llara","text":"I take it you're here to find out more about [Amstaf]."},{"npc":"Llara","text":"I've known Amstaf since he was a child. We grew up in the same city together. Ever since I've known him there's always been something [unusual] about him."},{"npc":"Llara","text":"When we were growing up we used to venture outside the city gates. Some times we would encounter a wandering ghoul or an undead spirit of some sort. He was always able to quickly dismiss the undead being with very little effort. I [learned] many things growing up with Amstaf."},{"npc":"Llara","text":"Amstaf told me many things when we were younger. Once Amstaf told me that life isn't about how you get there, it's about where you end up. I miss my dear friend. Its been a long time since I've seen him. The night of the snowstorm I dreamt about him. I remember seeing Amstaf's face. I saw something I've never [seen] before."},{"npc":"Llara","text":"I saw desperation. I spoke to many people who knew Amstaf trying to find out if anyone heard anything about that night. No one knew anything about it. When I had reached the dwarven hunting grounds I ran into a woman named Walnan. She kept rambling on and on about the power of the Orb and something about Magi`kot. I didn't understand what she was saying. She didn't know anything about my situation either, but she did tell me that there were others that may be able to help me. She told me that I should find [Ruathey]."},{"npc":"Ruathey","text":"Hello ______."},{"npc":"Ruathey","text":"I've heard stories about a holy sword. There are many rumored to be hidden all throughout the world, yet only a few have actually been found. Amstaf had one of these swords. It is known for its ability to dismiss the undead. Perhaps by having this sword it'll bring you closer to finding your friend. Gather a Ghoul's Heart, Amstaf's Scroll, the Blade of Nobility, a noblemans hilt and place them in this [bag]."}],"fetchedAt":"2026-09-23T06:12:10.406Z","outOfEra":true}
Guild Summons - Wolves of the North	25	{"kind":"quest","title":"Guild Summons - Wolves of the North","wikiPath":"/Guild_Summons_-_Wolves_of_the_North","sources":[{"kind":"quest","where":"Halas","detail":"Start zone"},{"kind":"quest","where":"A tattered note","detail":"Quest giver"}],"components":[],"rewards":[{"text":"Patched Fur Tunic*","item":"Patched Fur Tunic*","wikiPath":"/Patched_Fur_Tunic*"}],"card":{"title":"Guild Summons - Wolves of the North","lines":["Minimum Level: 1","Classes: Warrior","Related Zones: None"]},"links":["Halas","A tattered note","Warrior","Patched Fur Tunic*","Kylan O'Danos","Rogues of the White Rose","Shadowed Men","Merchants of Halas","Steel Warriors"],"dialogue":[{"npc":"Kylan O'Danos","text":"Greetin's! We are the mighty Wolves o' the North, protectors o' Halas, and we must work hard t' keep it safe fer our citizens. Here is our tunic, it identifies ye as a proud warrior o' this great city. Let's get started with yer training, then, shall we?"}],"fetchedAt":"2026-09-23T06:12:11.499Z","outOfEra":false}
